      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This prayer for Canada was written by Rabbi Victor Reinstein in the early 1990s during his tenure as rabbi of Congregation Emanu-El in Victoria, British Columbia (from 1982-1998). The prayer is in use by several other congregations in Canada. In Victoria, the prayer has been slightly edited to include names of local indigenous peoples.</tei:p>
